# Architecture decision records

Accepted project decisions:

- ADR 0001: Adopt mod-base public evidence (add the file, then link it here)

An ADR records the evidence and trade-offs behind a decision. Operational instructions remain in
the focused human and AI documentation linked from the repository root. Name each record
`NNNN-short-imperative-title.md` with the sections Status, Context, Decision and Consequences, and
mark a record "Superseded by" or "Partially superseded by" instead of rewriting it.
